[[SECTION]]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-PROMPT-OVERLAY
TITLE: Public Prompt Overlay

[[SECTION]]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-PROMPT-OVERLAY-ELEMENT
TITLE: Prompt Overlay

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-107
TITLE: Semantic
STATEMENT: >>>
The Public Prompt Overlay SHALL present the Prompt Contents it is given over the current public page while open, SHALL omit its presentation when closed, and SHALL close when the visitor dismisses it.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
No Public Frontend PIR defines a prompt overlay. Contents are the prompt data; the overlay is the Container that presents those Contents over a public page. Callers supply existing Prompt Contents shapes; this requirement does not invent Contents fields or backend endpoints. Contact Overlay Contents remain a separate feature. Derived because PIRs do not define this overlay.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Proposed for owner review (GSSC5-27). Shell only; Contact Overlay UI remains GSSC5-31.
<<<
DERIVED: True
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-27
REVIEW_STATUS: Changed

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-108
TITLE: Syntactic
STATEMENT: >>>
The Public Prompt Overlay SHALL cover the viewport while open, place a contents panel over a dimmed page backdrop, and keep that panel within the viewport as the page resizes.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Covering the viewport and dimming the page focuses the visitor on the Prompt Contents. Keeping the panel within the viewport preserves that focus as the page resizes.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Proposed for owner review (GSSC5-27).
<<<
DERIVED: True
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-27
REVIEW_STATUS: Changed

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-109
TITLE: Lexical
STATEMENT: >>>
The Public Prompt Overlay SHALL use the black theme token at reduced opacity for its backdrop, the white theme token for the contents panel background, the gray theme token for the panel border, the dark-green theme token for panel text, and the sans-serif theme font.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Theme tokens keep overlay presentation aligned with the organization palette. A fuller color role map for overlays is not set yet beyond these token choices.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Proposed for owner review (GSSC5-27). Color tokens remain provisional until a full color role map exists.
<<<
DERIVED: True
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-27
REVIEW_STATUS: Changed

[[/SECTION]]

